            "tab_id": "most",
            "tips_title_1": "Tip #1",
            "tips_sub_title_1": "Don’t underplay it",
            "tips_text_1": "<p>Most people walk into their assessment trying to look more \"together\" than they are. Don't - your psychiatrist needs the real picture to make an accurate diagnosis.</p>",
            "tips_title_2": "Tip #2",
            "tips_sub_title_2": "Give it 6-10 weeks",
            "tips_text_2": "<p>Finding your right ADHD dose takes time. The first dose almost never feels right - that's normal, and it's why we review you every two weeks during titration. The goal isn't speed. It's a dose you can stay on for years.</p>"
          }
        },
