          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "content_tab_id": "most",
            "heading": "How much does an assessment cost, and what's included?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our ADHD assessment costs £XXX and includes a full online psychiatric evaluation, a detailed review of your symptoms and history, a diagnosis where appropriate, and a personalised treatment plan. <br/><br/>You’ll meet with a specialist clinician who will guide you through the process and answer any questions you have.</p>"
          }
        },
