          "settings": {
            "content_tab_id": "most",
            "heading": "What medication do you prescribe?",
            "row_content": "<p>If medication is recommended after your assessment, your clinician will discuss the most suitable options based on your needs.<br/><br/>We prescribe commonly used ADHD medications, including stimulant and non-stimulant treatments, and support you through titration to find the right dose.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wtjkbx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "content_tab_id": "most",
            "heading": "Will my GP take over my prescription? (Shared care)",
            "row_content": "<p>Once your medication and dose are stable, we can provide the necessary information for a shared care agreement with your GP.<br/><br/>Many GPs accept shared care, allowing them to continue your ongoing prescriptions, but acceptance is always at your GP’s discretion.</p>"
          }
        },
