            "heading": "Is Settle right for me if I've been assessed before?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. If you’ve already had an ADHD assessment, Settle can still support you.<br/><br/>Our clinicians can review your previous assessment, discuss your current needs, and help with ongoing treatment, medication management, or next steps where appropriate.</p>"
